    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "We will also write this density as $p(\\mathbf{x}, \\mu, \\mathbf{V})$ when we wish to stress that it is a function of the mean vector $\\mu$ and the covariance matrix $\\mathbf{V}$.",
      "source_page": 211,
      "printed_page": 191,
