    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "More generally, when the elements of x are correlated, Equation 8.24 gives the probability density function for a vector of multivariate normally distributed random variables, with mean vector $ \\mu $ and covariance matrix V. We denote this by",
      "source_page": 211,
      "printed_page": 191,
